\newlabel{fig:posterior_geometry_main}{{5}{20}{Posterior geometry differs across event-time losses even when scalar nRMSE is similar. Panel A reports R11 scalar readout after selecting the softmax temperature on R9--R10 to minimize nRMSE. Panel B aligns predicted posteriors to the true RT. Panels C--E summarize posterior width, near-target mass, and mode-mean disagreement. Panel F compares empirical coverage of central posterior intervals; the diagonal is ideal interval coverage}{figure.5}{}}
