\newlabel{fig:appendix_temperature_sensitivity}{{9}{29}{Temperature sensitivity on the R9-R10 development split. Vertical lines mark selected temperatures. The curves show that different losses induce different confidence scales, motivating temperature calibration as posterior-geometry control before comparing scalar readouts or using posterior features downstream}{figure.9}{}}
